<title>USA: HIGHWAY SETS INITIAL SEMIANNUAL DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>HIGHWAY SETS INITIAL SEMIANNUAL DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highway Holdings Ltd on Thursday said it has set an initial semiannual cash dividend of $0.0127 per share on the company's common stock for the six-month period ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid October 3, to shareholders of record on September 2.</p>
